  aciklama:
  - "Asl\u0131nda do\u011Fruyu s\xF6ylemeyene de\u011Fil, her duydu\u011Funu, \"do\u011Frulamadan\"
    ba\u015Fkas\u0131na aktarana \"yalanc\u0131\" denir. Telvelerin f\u0131s\u0131lt\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131,
    kimseden onay alma ve do\u011Frulama ihtiyac\u0131 hissetmeden aktard\u0131\u011F\u0131m
    i\xE7in, bana da yalanc\u0131 diyorlar. Fakat yalanc\u0131lar\u0131n en b\xFCy\xFC\u011F\xFC
    benim, o nedenle ad\u0131m Magnus! <sprite=7> Kahve fal\u0131 yorumuma ho\u015F
    geldin {{isim}}. Fincan\u0131nda, {{kelime, par\xE7a par\xE7a b\xF6l\xFCmler
    ve ayr\u0131k hikayeler | birbirinden ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z gibi g\xF6z\xFCken
    baz\u0131 haberler | bir arada gibi g\xF6z\xFCken fakat farkl\u0131 sonu\xE7lar
    do\u011Furaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm baz\u0131 haberler
    | birbirleriyle ilintili olmalar\u0131na ra\u011Fmen ayr\u0131 noktalara yerle\u015Fmi\u015F
    baz\u0131 haberler}} var. Hepsinden s\u0131rayla s\xF6z edece\u011Fim. Ba\u015Flayal\u0131m
    m\u0131?"
